[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4201134145","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118263#issuecomment-4201134145","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118263","id":4201134145,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc76aDhB","user":{"login":"Synzorasize","id":60207816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjA3ODE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60207816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize","html_url":"https://github.com/Synzorasize","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-07T17:55:12Z","updated_at":"2026-04-07T17:55:12Z","body":"Most builtin class properties can be stored in scene files because they have the usage flag `PROPERTY_USAGE_STORAGE`, but they might not have `PROPERTY_USAGE_EDITOR` which exposes them to the inspector. The only way I can think of to do that is something like this (works for any `Object` including `Node`s):\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends CharacterBody3D\n\nfunc _get_property_list() -> Array[Dictionary]:\n\treturn [\n\t\t{\n\t\t\t\"name\": \"velocity\",\n\t\t\t\"type\": TYPE_VECTOR3,\n\t\t\t\"hint\": PROPERTY_HINT_NONE,\n\t\t\t\"hint_string\": \"suffix:m\",\n\t\t\t\"usage\": PROPERTY_USAGE_EDITOR\n\t\t}\n\t]\n```\nBut of course, the user has to set that manually so they might not have the foresight ahead of time that this might happen, and it's pretty advanced. But still, it might be a good idea to expose variables you always use.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4201134145/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4214653579","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118263#issuecomment-4214653579","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118263","id":4214653579,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc77NoKL","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-09T13:34:31Z","updated_at":"2026-04-09T13:36:09Z","body":"For some reason the velocity property is registered with NO_EDITOR flag, even though it has unit suffix assigned.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/755fa449c4aa94fdf2c58e2b726fd62efde07e09/scene/2d/physics/character_body_2d.cpp#L742\nMight be not intended.\n\nThe `max_slides` property is also hidden for some reason.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4214653579/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]